<title>NETHERLANDS: DIARY - Dutch economic indicators week of Nov 11.</title>
<headline>DIARY - Dutch economic indicators week of Nov 11.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said on Friday it planned to publish the following key Dutch economic indicators next week.</p>
<p>    GMT----date----indicator------------period---previous</p>
<p>    0830  11/11    producer prices	Sept     + 1.1 pct yr/yr</p>
<p>    0830  15/11    balance of trade     July-Aug + Dfl 2.4 bln</p>
<p>    0830  15/11    manufacturing sales  Sept     + 4 pct yr/yr</p>
<p>NOTE - The CBS said publication of Dutch Aug/Oct unemployment figures, which had been expected for Nov 14, had been postponed until the week starting Nov 18.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
